  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "The ending **-ся** is added after a consonant and **-сь** after a vowel: **одеваться**, **мыться**, **встречаться**; when conjugated, the suffix goes at the end: **я одеваюсь**, **ты одеваешься**, **он одевается**. Also learn the meaning of each verb: **учиться** means «to study»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reciprocal and reflexive",
     "texto": [
      "With a mutual sense: **Мы встречаемся в кафе** (we are meeting up at the café). With a reflexive sense: **Я одеваюсь быстро** (I get dressed quickly)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
